UPDATE companies SET description='Medical operates a 35,000-square-foot manufacturing facility in Northeast Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. The company is an FDA-compliant manufacturer of Class I and Class II dental and medical devices, offering contract manufacturing services including finishing, packaging, and full traceability with device-history records for every lot.

The facility combines high-tolerance machining and injection molding with metal processing capabilities such as machining, forging, sharpening, brazing, and polishing of surgical-grade stainless steels (303, 304, 316, 440A), titanium, nitinol, copper, and brass. Plastic processing covers polyethylene, polypropylene, nylon, ABS, and Radel using molding units and cleaning procedures. Automated assembly and packaging are available for selected items, and in-house new product development teams support projects from concept to market-ready packages.

serves the dental and medical device industries, producing items such as impression trays, periodontal probes, composite polishing systems, ultrasonic inserts, reusable loop electrodes, gynecologic sampling instruments, cervical and uterine dilators, cannula instruments, molded products, and tracheostomy tubes. Customers include companies requiring precision metal and plastic components for surgical and diagnostic applications.

The company emphasizes complete lot traceability, decades of experience with specialized metals, and ISO 13485:2016 certification as differentiators. Automated packaging and in-house tooling design aim to ensure process repeatability for custom orders.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485:2016']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["High-tolerance machining", "Forging", "Sharpening", "Brazing", "Polishing", "Injection molding", "Plastic molding", "Plastic cleaning", "Automated assembly", "Automated packaging", "Finishing operations", "Packaging", "Lot traceability and device-history records", "Custom metal forming", "Automated bending", "Laser marking", "Stamping", "New product development", "Contract manufacturing"], "industries": ["Dental devices", "Medical devices", "Surgical instruments"], "materials": ["303 Stainless Steel", "304 Stainless Steel", "316 Stainless Steel", "440A Stainless Steel", "Nitinol", "Titanium", "Copper", "Brass", "Polyethylene", "Polypropylene", "Nylon", "ABS", "Radel"], "equipment": ["Molding units", "Custom-forming dies", "Automated bending devices", "Automated packaging equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["FDA-compliant Class I and II medical device manufacturing", "Complete traceability and device-history records per lot", "High-tolerance machining and injection molding expertise", "Decades of experience processing surgical-grade metals (stainless steel, titanium, nitinol)", "ISO 13485:2016 certified quality system"], "facts_used": ["35,000 sq ft facility in Northeast Philadelphia, Pennsylvania -> page /", "FDA-compliant manufacturer of Class I and Class II dental/medical devices -> page /", "Provides finishing operations, packaging, traceability, device-history records -> page /", "High-tolerance machining and injection molding expertise -> page /", "Processes surgical-grade stainless steels, titanium, aluminum, nitinol, specialized metals -> page /", "Metal processing: machining, forging, sharpening