UPDATE companies SET description='Putnam Medical Corporation is based in Dayville, Connecticut, where it operates a 20,000-square-foot facility. The company was co-founded by Ryan Dandeneau, who serves as CEO, and is part of the Putnam family''s medical device portfolio that includes sister company Putnam Plastics, a technology leader for over 40 years.

