UPDATE companies SET description='Carrion, who brings over 35 years of experience in architectural woodworking, metalwork, cabinetry, and millwork, previously founded MCA Woodworkers Inc. on Long Island in 2004. After serving five years as director of production for Store Fixtures, he returned to business ownership to establish the current shop.

