UPDATE companies SET description='ReVision Energy is headquartered in North Andover, Massachusetts, with operations across Maine, New Hampshire, and Massachusetts. The two entities merged in 2008 to form ReVision Energy, and the business converted to a 100% employee stock ownership plan (ESOP) in 2017.

The company designs and installs solar photovoltaic systems, battery storage, heat pumps, and electric vehicle charging stations for residential and commercial customers, and provides ongoing service and maintenance.

Notable projects include the Keene Housing affordable‑housing solar array, the Hooksett landfill solar installation for town and school energy savings, and the Small Business Solar Accelerator program for local enterprises.

