UPDATE companies SET description='Red V Foods operates from Buford, Georgia, where its history traces back to the mid-1800s. The company''s founders developed a desiccation process to prevent spoilage of coconut goods during long voyages from Asia. Today, Red V Foods is a subsidiary of Axelum Resources Corp., a Philippines-based manufacturer of coconut ingredients.

The company manufactures and distributes a range of coconut products including desiccated, sweetened, and toasted coconut, coconut milk powder, cream, milk, and oil. It runs an 11,000-square-foot manufacturing and distribution facility alongside more than 100,000 square feet of climate-controlled warehousing. A team of over 40 employees handles sourcing, manufacturing, co-packing, private labeling, and oil-filling services, supported by Axelum''s 4,000-plus workforce in the Philippines.

Red V Foods serves food and beverage brands, food manufacturers, food service providers, distributors, and retailers across North and South America, including the U.S., Canada, Mexico, Brazil, and Chile. It acts as a co-packing partner for several large retail brands, offering custom formulation and packaging.

The company emphasizes a direct supply chain through its parent company, eliminating middlemen, and maintains SQF certification with GMP and HACCP programs. Its facility is also certified organic, non-GMO, kosher, and halal. Axelum''s laboratories hold ISO 17025 accreditation, and the parent company pursues near-zero-waste manufacturing and community development programs.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF Food Safety Code for Manufacturing','USDA Organic','Non-GMO','Kosher','Halal','GMP','HACCP','ISO 17025 (Axelum Laboratories)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sourcing", "Manufacturing", "Co-packing", "Private labeling", "Oil-filling", "Desiccation", "Custom formulation", "Custom packaging", "Warehousing", "Third-party logistics"], "industries": ["Food and beverage brands", "Food manufacturers", "Food service providers", "Distributors", "Retailers", "Private label retailers"], "materials": ["Coconut", "Coconut meat", "Coconut milk", "Coconut cream", "Coconut oil"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Individual cartons to truckloads or container loads", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Direct supply chain via parent company Axelum Resources Corp. (no middleman)", "SQF-certified facility with GMP and HACCP programs", "USDA-certified organic and non-GMO product lines", "Over 100,000 sq. ft. climate-controlled warehousing", "Turnkey co-packing and private label with custom formulation"], "facts_used": ["Location: Buford, Georgia -> /about-us", "History traces to mid-1800s -> /about-us", "Subsidiary of Axelum Resources Corp. -> /about-us", "SQF-certified facility -> /about-us", "Over 100,000 sq. ft. climate-controlled warehousing -> /", "11,000 sq. ft. manufacturing and distribution facility -> /about-us", "Employs over 40 team members at Buford -> /about-us", "Parent company employs over 4,000 -> /about-us", "Products: desiccated, sweetened, toasted coconut, coconut milk powder, cream, milk, oil -> /", "Services: sourcing, manufacturing, co-packing, private lab