UPDATE companies SET description='Renewable Energy Design Group operates from Charlotte, North Carolina, and has served the Carolinas since its founding in 2012. The company focuses on solar energy consulting and installation for both residential and commercial clients across North and South Carolina.

The firm provides end-to-end solar solutions including system design, photovoltaic installation, and battery storage integration. Its services cover residential rooftop arrays, commercial-scale projects, and backup power systems that function during grid outages.

