UPDATE companies SET description='Renewable Energy Systems, LLC was founded in 2008 in Avilla, Indiana. The independently owned and operated company began as a pioneer in solar energy for Indiana and surrounding areas, focusing on giving customers control over their electricity production and usage.

The firm provides end-to-end solar photovoltaic services, including engineering, procurement, and construction (EPC) for commercial, industrial, agricultural, and residential projects. Its capabilities cover custom system design, installation, and operations & maintenance (O&M) repair, with experience delivering utility-scale systems exceeding 1 megawatt. All installations are performed by NABCEP-certified technicians, and the company operates a Department of Labor-registered apprenticeship program to train solar professionals.

Renewable Energy Systems serves businesses, farms, schools, and homeowners across northeastern Indiana, southern Michigan, and northwestern Ohio. Commercial clients receive systems designed to reduce energy costs, while industrial customers can access utility-scale engineering and subcontracting services. Agricultural projects target operational efficiency, and residential installations aim to maximize home energy production.

The company distinguishes itself through a veteran-friendly hiring program recognized with the HIRE Vets Medallion Award, a commitment to NABCEP certification across its workforce, and a service model that assigns the same technician from initial assessment through installation and future maintenance. It also assists customers with federal tax credits, USDA REAP grants, and depreciation strategies to improve project economics.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP PV Associate Certification','NABCEP PV Installation Professional Certification','HIRE Vets Medallion Award','Apprenticeship program registered with U.S. Department of Labor','Apprenticeship program approved by Indiana Department of Veterans Affairs']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar PV system design", "Solar PV installation", "Solar PV operations & maintenance (O&M) repair", "Engineering, Procurement, Construction (EPC) services", "Customized engineering and sub-contracting for utility-scale systems", "Site assessment and energy needs analysis", "Financial incentive consulting (federal tax credits, USDA REAP grants, depreciation)", "Apprenticeship training for solar professionals"], "industries": ["Commercial", "Industrial", "Agricultural", "Residential", "Education (schools)", "Utility-scale solar"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["NABCEP-certified installation professionals", "Full EPC service from design through construction", "Department of Labor-registered apprenticeship program", "HIRE Vets Medallion Award for veteran employment", "Free site assessment and incentive consulting"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2008 -> db", "Headquarters Avilla, Indiana -> db", "Independently owned and operated -> /about", "Designs, installs, and services solar products -> /about", "EPC contractor handling engineering, procurement, construction -> /", "NABCEP certified installers -> /about", "Utility-scale systems over 1MW -> /services", "Commercial, industr