UPDATE companies SET description='Renogy, a solar energy product manufacturer, was founded in 2009 and is headquartered in Chino, California. The company employs between 200 and 499 people.

The company produces monocrystalline and flexible solar panels, charge controllers, battery systems, inverters, battery monitors, and DC-DC chargers. Its product line includes the ShadowFlux™ N-Type anti-shading solar panels with 25% efficiency, 12V 300Ah LiFePO4 batteries with low-temperature protection, and pure sine wave inverters delivering over 90% efficiency.

Renogy serves recreational vehicle (RV), marine, commercial, and off-grid markets, as well as tiny-house and workshop DIY customers. Its solutions are marketed for RV expeditions, tiny-house energy independence, and workshop productivity.

