UPDATE companies SET description='Resco Products Inc. was founded in 1976 in Moulton, Alabama, as a privately owned refractory manufacturer.

Its capabilities encompass custom refractory design, engineering support, and extensive testing of mechanical, physical, and high-temperature properties. The company operates an experienced engineering department backed by state-of-the-art equipment to develop tailored solutions for demanding applications.

Resco serves major industries such as steel, copper, nickel, aluminum, hydrocarbon processing, cement, and lime production. Concrete applications include steel ladles, cement kilns, copper and nickel smelting, CO boilers, and ferro alloy furnaces. The company also supports nonferrous metals and petrochemical sectors with specialized refractory linings.

