UPDATE companies SET description='Richelieu Foods was founded in 1862 in Beaver Dam, Wisconsin, beginning as a regional operation before evolving into a private-brand manufacturer. In 2018, the company joined the Freiberger Group, a wholly owned subsidiary of Südzucker AG, expanding its reach to a network of 11 locations across Europe and the United States.

