UPDATE companies SET description='Rivers Metal Products was founded in 1973 in Lincoln, Nebraska. The company began as a metal fabrication shop and has since expanded into rotational mold manufacturing and metal distribution.

The company provides custom metal fabrication, rotational mold tooling and repair, contract manufacturing, architectural and interior metalwork, signage, and fine art fabrication. Its shop is equipped for MIG, TIG, arc, and resistance welding; laser, plasma, and flame cutting; shearing, sawing, plate rolling, tube bending, pipe coiling, brake pressing, lathe and mill machining. Rivers Metal also stocks and distributes steel, stainless steel, aluminum, galvanized, polished, brushed, and hot- and cold-rolled sheet metal.

Rivers Metal serves industrial, architectural, artistic, and agricultural clients. Longtime partner Peregrine, Inc. has collaborated for more than 30 years. The firm has fabricated 22,000-gallon rotational molds, agricultural tanks, machinery components, stairways, railings, and public art installations such as the “Backyard Oasis” project for Loeck Designs and community pride sculptures.

The company says its differentiator lies in its consultative approach—guiding customers from material selection through design and production—and its half-century of experience pioneering fabricated stainless-steel rotational molds. Its mission emphasizes hard work, integrity, and customer service, aiming to improve quality of life for customers, employees, suppliers, and the community.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["MIG welding", "TIG welding", "Arc welding", "Resistance welding", "Laser cutting", "Plasma cutting", "Flame cutting", "Shearing", "Sawing", "Plate rolling", "Tube bending", "Pipe coiling", "Brake pressing", "Lathe machining", "Milling", "Structural metal fabrication", "Metal tooling", "Polishing", "Finishing", "Metal assembly", "Metal punching", "Metal tapping", "Rotational mold tooling", "Rotational mold repair", "Rotational mold fixtures"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Steel", "Stainless Steel", "Aluminum", "Galvanized, Polished, & Brushed", "Hot Rolled & Cold Rolled Sheet Metal"], "equipment": ["Mig Welders", "Tig Welders", "Arc Welders", "Resistance Welders", "Laser Cutter", "Plasma Cutter", "Flame Cutter", "Shears", "Saws", "Plate Rollers", "Tube Benders", "Pipe Coiling", "Brake Presses", "Lathes", "Mills"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Pioneer and innovator of fabricated stainless-steel rotational molds since 1973", "Consultative process from material selection through design and production", "Stocks a wide range of metal materials and sources hard-to-find alloys", "Handles projects from 22,000-gallon rotational molds to small bolt assemblies", "Over 50 years of metal fabrication experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1973 in Lincoln, Nebraska -> db, /about", "Metal fabricator and distributor -> db description", "Pioneer in rotational molds since 1973 -> /services", "Equipment list (Mig/Tig/Arc/Resistance welders, laser/plasma/flame cutters, shears, saws, plate rollers, tube bende